<view class="daily-page page-with-nav">
  <view class="daily-panel">
    <view class="daily-eyebrow"><text class="daily-eyebrow__spark">✦</text> 今日校园观察</view>
    <view class="daily-title">记录今天，孩子在学校发生的事</view>
    <view class="daily-subtitle">说出学生姓名和事情，AI 会整理成记录并放入待校对清单；确认无误后才会通知对应家长。</view>

    <view class="voice-panel">
      <button
        class="voice-button"
        wx:if="{{!recording}}"
        bindtap="startRecording"
        disabled="{{transcribing || creating}}"
      >
        <view class="mic-shape" aria-hidden="true">
          <view class="mic-shape__head"></view>
          <view class="mic-shape__stem"></view>
          <view class="mic-shape__base"></view>
        </view>
        <text>{{transcribing ? '正在转写' : '点击开始说'}}</text>
      </button>
      <button class="voice-button voice-button--recording" wx:else bindtap="stopRecording">
        <view class="record-wave"><text></text><text></text><text></text><text></text></view>
        <text>停止录音 · {{recordSeconds}} 秒</text>
      </button>
      <view class="voice-hint">普通话语音，也可直接输入文字</view>
    </view>

    <view class="record-status record-status--{{statusTone}}">
      <view class="record-status__dot"></view>
      <text>{{statusText}}</text>
    </view>

    <view class="daily-divider"></view>

    <view class="editor-shell">
      <textarea
        class="daily-editor"
        placeholder="补充文字记录（可选）"
        placeholder-class="daily-editor__placeholder"
        maxlength="2000"
        value="{{transcript}}"
        bindinput="onTranscriptInput"
        disabled="{{creating}}"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="publish-row">
      <text class="char-count">{{charCount}} / 2000</text>
      <button
        class="publish-button"
        bindtap="onCreate"
        disabled="{{recording || transcribing || creating || !transcript}}"
      ><text class="publish-button__spark">✦</text> {{creating ? '整理中…' : '加入待校对清单'}}</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 待校对清单 -->
  <view class="draft-section">
    <view class="draft-heading">
      <view class="draft-heading__main">
        <text class="draft-heading__title">待校对清单</text>
        <text class="draft-heading__count">{{draftCount}} 条</text>
      </view>
      <button
        wx:if="{{draftCount}}"
        class="draft-confirm-all"
        bindtap="onConfirmAll"
        disabled="{{confirming}}"
      >{{confirming ? '发送中…' : '全部确认无误'}}</button>
    </view>

    <view class="draft-tip" wx:if="{{draftCount}}">
      每条记录都会先列在这里，并标注将推送给哪些家长。确认无误后才会发送；若当天未手动确认，将在每天 {{autoSendTime}} 自动发送给 AI 判定的家长。
    </view>

    <view class="state-card" wx:if="{{loading}}">同步清单中…</view>
    <view class="state-card" wx:if="{{!loading && error}}">
      <view>{{error}}</view>
      <button class="retry-button" bindtap="onRetry">重新加载</button>
    </view>

    <view class="draft-empty" wx:if="{{!loading && !error && !draftCount}}">
      还没有待校对的记录。上面的录音或文字整理后，会出现在这里等待您确认。
    </view>

    <view class="draft-card" wx:for="{{drafts}}" wx:key="id">
      <view class="draft-card__top">
        <text class="draft-card__student">{{item.studentName}}</text>
        <text class="draft-card__badge">{{item.statusText}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="draft-card__summary">{{item.summary}}</view>

      <view class="recipient-block">
        <view class="recipient-block__label">
          <text>将推送给</text>
          <text class="recipient-block__count">{{item.recipientCount}} 位家长</text>
        </view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.recipients.length}}" class="recipient-tags">
          <text class="recipient-tag" wx:for="{{item.recipients}}" wx:for-item="person" wx:key="userId">{{person.name}}<text wx:if="{{person.childNameText}}" class="recipient-tag__child">{{person.childNameText}}</text></text>
        </view>
        <view wx:elif="{{item.recipientDetailMissing}}" class="recipient-empty recipient-empty--muted">这条早期记录只保存了推送人数，未保存推送对象明细</view>
        <view wx:else class="recipient-empty">未设置推送对象，请点击「校对推送对象」指定</view>
      </view>

      <view class="draft-card__foot">
        <view class="draft-card__meta">{{item.timeText}} · {{item.aiStatus}}</view>
        <view class="draft-card__actions">
          <text class="draft-link" catchtap="onDeleteDraft" data-id="{{item.id}}">删除</text>
          <text class="draft-link" catchtap="onEditDraft" data-id="{{item.id}}">校对推送对象</text>
          <text class="draft-link draft-link--primary" catchtap="onConfirmOne" data-id="{{item.id}}">确认无误</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 已发送 -->
  <view class="recent-section" wx:if="{{!loading && !error && sentList.length}}">
    <view class="recent-heading"><text>已发送</text><text>{{sentList.length}} 条</text></view>
    <view class="recent-card" wx:for="{{sentList}}" wx:key="id">
      <view class="recent-card__top">
        <text class="recent-card__student">{{item.studentName}}</text>
        <text class="recent-card__time">{{item.timeText}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="recent-card__summary">{{item.summary}}</view>
      <view class="recent-card__meta">{{item.statusText}} · {{item.recipientCount ? '已通知 ' + item.recipientCount + ' 位家长' : '未匹配家长'}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 校对弹层：层级高于底部导航栏，内容区可滚动，底部按钮常驻可见 -->
  <view class="sheet-mask" wx:if="{{editing}}" bindtap="onEditCancel">
    <view class="sheet" catchtap="noop">
      <view class="sheet__handle"></view>
      <view class="sheet__title">校对推送对象</view>
      <view class="sheet__subtitle">{{editing.studentName}} · 勾选将收到这条记录的家长</view>

      <view class="sheet__label">推送对象（{{editing.selectedCount}}）</view>
      <scroll-view class="sheet__options" scroll-y>
        <view
          class="option-row"
          wx:for="{{recipientOptions}}"
          wx:key="userId"
          data-id="{{item.userId}}"
          bindtap="onToggleRecipient"
        >
          <view class="checkbox {{item.checked ? 'checked' : ''}}"></view>
          <view class="option-row__text">
            <text class="option-row__name">{{item.name}}</text>
            <text class="option-row__meta">{{item.relation}} · {{item.childName}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view class="option-state" wx:if="{{recipientLoading}}">正在加载可推送的家长…</view>
        <view class="option-state option-state--error" wx:elif="{{recipientError}}">
          <text>{{recipientError}}</text>
          <button class="option-retry" catchtap="onRetryRecipients">重新加载</button>
        </view>
        <view class="option-state" wx:elif="{{!recipientOptions.length}}">
          暂无可推送的家长。请确认家长已绑定孩子，且已在管理员端加入班级。
        </view>
      </scroll-view>

      <view class="sheet__label sheet__label--first">记录摘要</view>
      <textarea
        class="sheet__input"
        value="{{editing.summary}}"
        maxlength="260"
        bindinput="onEditSummaryInput"
        placeholder="一句话事实摘要"
      />

      <view class="sheet__label">发送给家长的内容</view>
      <textarea
        class="sheet__input sheet__input--tall"
        value="{{editing.parentMessage}}"
        maxlength="500"
        bindinput="onEditMessageInput"
        placeholder="家长会收到这段文字"
      />

      <view class="sheet__actions">
        <button class="sheet__btn" bindtap="onEditCancel">取消</button>
        <button class="sheet__btn sheet__btn--primary" bindtap="onEditSave" disabled="{{saving}}">
          {{saving ? '保存中…' : '保存校对'}}
        </button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>

<nav-bar role="teacher" active="workbench" />
